      "name": "💬 Messaging (E2EE & Server-Side)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Send E2EE Message (Private)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"message_id\", jsonData.data._id);",
                  "    console.log(\"🔒 E2EE message sent (admin cannot read)\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"recipient_id\": \"{{recipient_user_id}}\",\n  \"content\": \"<base64_encrypted_content>\",\n  \"chat_type\": \"private\",\n  \"encryption\": {\n    \"type\": \"e2ee\",\n    \"encrypted_keys\": {\n      \"sender_user_id\": \"<encrypted_aes_key_for_sender>\",\n      \"recipient_user_id\": \"<encrypted_aes_key_for_recipient>\"\n    },\n    \"iv\": \"<base64_iv>\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:4008/api/messages/send",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "4008",
              "path": ["api", "messages", "send"]
            },
            "description": "🔒 **Send End-to-End Encrypted Message**\n\n**Encryption Process (Client-side):**\n```javascript\n// 1. Generate AES-256 key\nconst aesKey = await crypto.subtle.generateKey(\n  { name: \"AES-CBC\", length: 256 },\n  true,\n  [\"encrypt\", \"decrypt\"]\n);\n\n// 2. Generate random IV\nconst iv = crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(16));\n\n// 3. Encrypt message with AES\nconst encrypted = await crypto.subtle.encrypt(\n  { name: \"AES-CBC\", iv },\n  aesKey,\n  new TextEncoder().encode(plaintext)\n);\n\n// 4. Encrypt AES key with recipient's RSA public key\nconst encryptedKey = await crypto.subtle.encrypt(\n  { name: \"RSA-OAEP\" },\n  recipientPublicKey,\n  await crypto.subtle.exportKey(\"raw\", aesKey)\n);\n\n// 5. Send to server\nfetch('/api/messages/send', {\n  method: 'POST',\n  body: JSON.stringify({\n    recipient_id: recipientId,\n    content: arrayBufferToBase64(encrypted),\n    chat_type: 'private',\n    encryption: {\n      type: 'e2ee',\n      encrypted_keys: {\n        [senderId]: encryptedKeyForSender,\n        [recipientId]: arrayBufferToBase64(encryptedKey)\n      },\n      iv: arrayBufferToBase64(iv)\n    }\n  })\n});\n```\n\n**Result:** Message stored encrypted, admin CANNOT decrypt"
          }
        },
