              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "4008",
              "path": ["api", "messages", "send"]
            },
            "description": "💬 **Send Marketplace Message (Server-Side)**\n\n**Purpose:** Communicate about property listings, admin can view for dispute resolution\n\n**Body:**\n- `content`: Plain text message\n- `chat_type`: \"marketplace\" (or \"support\", \"dispute\")\n- `metadata`: Context info (listing_id, property_id, etc.)\n\n**Difference from E2EE:**\n- ❌ No encryption object\n- ✅ Admin can read content\n- ✅ Searchable by admin\n- ✅ Can be flagged for review\n\n**Use Cases:**\n- Marketplace negotiations\n- Customer support tickets\n- Dispute resolution\n- Evidence preservation"
          }
